      "CVE": "CVE-2026-115506",
      "Description": "libexpat through 2.9.0 contains a denial of service vulnerability because billion laughs protection in accountingDiffTolerated() in xmlparse.c detects entity amplification too late. Attackers can supply a moderately sized XML document with a large DTD and nested entity expansions to consume tens of seconds of CPU per parse.",
      "Threats": [
        {
          "Type": "Impact",
          "Severity": "moderate"
        }
